</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Explain why</p>

<p>
<md>\ln(x+y)
=
\ln x+\ln y</md>
</p>

<p>is generally false.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Complete the square:</p>

<p>
<md>x^2+8x+3.</md>
</p>
</statement>
